<title>USA: No wheat purchase made by CCC for Eritrea.</title>
<headline>No wheat purchase made by CCC for Eritrea.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Commodity Credit Corp of the U.S. Agriculture Department said it did not buy any wheat in its tender Friday for Eritrea.</p>
<p>The CCC had sought about 35,000 tonnes of U.S. No.2 or better hard red winter, soft red winter or soft white wheat for donation to Eritrea. Shipment was to be Oct 10-Nov 5.</p>
<p>No reason was given by the CCC for its declining to buy the wheat.</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720--</p>
</text>
